<section class="mushroom-benefits">
  {%- comment -%} Rolling water layers, shared component with the product pages {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="wave-field" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="wave wave--back"></span>
    <span class="wave wave--mid"></span>
    <span class="wave wave--front"></span>
  </div>
  <div class="section-inner">

    {%- comment -%} Section 2 — Why one system beats three promises {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">Why One System Beats Three Promises</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Built in the Right Order</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Most wellness drinks pile on ingredients and pile on promises — focus! energy! balance! — all shouting at once. Your body doesn’t work that way.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="system-story">
      <p>It works in sequence. When you’re stressed, your body is too busy managing the noise to make real use of anything else. Focus won’t stick. Energy feels scattered. Calm has to come first — it’s not a nice-to-have, it’s the foundation.</p>
      <p><strong>Fungi Fusion was designed around that order.</strong> One can. Three mushrooms. Each with a job, and each one setting up the next.</p>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} Section 3 — The three layers (calm → focus → fuel) {%- endcomment -%}
    <h3 class="system-layers-title">One Can. Three Layers.</h3>
    <div class="benefits-grid benefits-grid--3">

      <!-- Reishi — The Foundation -->
      <div class="benefit-card">
        <div class="benefit-icon-wrap">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6260AE" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 22V12"/>
            <path d="M12 12C12 12 7 10 6 6c3 0 6 2 6 6z"/>
            <path d="M12 12c0 0 5-2 6-6-3 0-6 2-6 6z"/>
            <path d="M12 12c0 0-3-5-1-9 2 1 4 5 1 9z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Reishi — The Foundation</h3>
        <div class="benefit-role">The calm layer</div>
        <p>Cherished for centuries as the mushroom of balance, Reishi helps your body settle — so everything that follows has somewhere steady to land.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Lion’s Mane — The Focus -->
      <div class="benefit-card">
        <div class="benefit-icon-wrap">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#52B788" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M9.5 2.5C7 2.5 5 4.5 5 7c0 1.8.9 3.3 2.3 4.2A3 3 0 0 0 6 13.5a3 3 0 0 0 2.1 2.87C8.4 17.9 9.6 19 11 19h2c1.4 0 2.6-1.1 2.9-2.63A3 3 0 0 0 18 13.5a3 3 0 0 0-1.3-2.48A4.5 4.5 0 0 0 14.5 2.5c-.9 0-1.7.28-2.3.75a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-2.7-.75z"/>
            <path d="M12 10v6M9.5 13h5"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Lion’s Mane — The Focus</h3>
        <div class="benefit-role">The clarity layer</div>
        <p>Loved for supporting clear thinking and steady concentration, Lion’s Mane does its best work on a calm foundation.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Cordyceps — The Fuel -->
      <div class="benefit-card">
        <div class="benefit-icon-wrap">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M13 2L4.5 13.5H11L10 22l9.5-11.5H13L13 2z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Cordyceps — The Fuel</h3>
        <div class="benefit-role">The energy layer</div>
        <p>Cordyceps supports your body’s natural energy production. No caffeine, no spike, no crash — clean fuel that lands where it should.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
    <p class="system-synergy">Calm isn’t the opposite of energy. It’s what makes energy work. That’s the Fungi Fusion difference — not three separate promises. One system, layered in the right order.</p>

    {%- comment -%} Section 5 — What's Inside (the ONE place the mg spec appears) {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="whats-inside">
      <div class="whats-inside-eyebrow">What’s Inside</div>
      <h3 class="whats-inside-title">Nothing to Hide. Everything to Feel.</h3>
      <p>Real mushroom extracts — not fillers — plus ocean-sourced trace minerals for everyday hydration support. Caffeine-free, so it fits any hour of your day. And every batch is third-party tested, with Certificates of Analysis you can actually read.</p>
      <p class="whats-inside-spec">900mg Lion’s Mane · 700mg Cordyceps · 400mg Reishi — full-spectrum extracts, per can by variety.</p>
      <a href="/pages/the-science#lab-results" class="whats-inside-link">See the lab results →</a>
    </div>

    <p class="benefits-disclaimer">† These statements have not been evaluated by the FDA. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.</p>
  </div>
</section>

